---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
import { formatDate, site } from '../lib/posts'
const updated = new Date('2026-11-25')
---

<Base title="Legal">
  <div class="prose prose-invert mx-auto pt-6">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-400">Last updated on <time datetime={updated.toISOString()}>{formatDate(updated)}</time></p>
    <p>This is a personal, non-commercial website. It is built to collect as little data about you as possible.</p>

    <h2>1. No tracking, no cookies</h2>
    <p>
      This website does not use analytics, does not set cookies, and does not load fonts, scripts or images from
      third-party servers.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Server logs</h2>
    <p>
      The website is hosted by netcup GmbH in Germany. As with any website, the hosting server automatically records
      technical access data such as your IP address, the time of the request, the page requested and your browser
      type. This data is used only to keep the site running securely and is not combined with other data.
    </p>

    <h2>3. Contacting me</h2>
    <p>
      If you send me an email, I use your address and the content of your message only to answer you.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Links to other sites</h2>
    <p>
      This website links to other sites. I am not responsible for their content or privacy practices.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      You can ask what personal data I hold about you and have it corrected or deleted by writing to
      <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Changes</h2>
    <p>If this policy changes, the new version is published here with a new date.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
